    {
      "op": "note",
      "text": "STAMP R4 (docs/pending/STAMP.md) with the virtual mouse (P-SLOW, P-FAST, P-WOBBLE): day 12 (by the cheat jump, every item given), ten travellers. Each lays its papers in a pile on the mat in the office view, the passport last (on top), then works in the reading view: (b) on a 3-paper pile, an accepted stroke with a re-grab 2 frames after the let-go (c<k>) and three refused tries on the pile (b<k>_i); with fewer papers, the rulebook is dragged over part of the passport and the accepted stroke with the re-grab lands at its edge (c<k>); (a) every traveller: the rulebook over the passport and a try 5-8 mm inside its edge (a<k>), within the 1 cm the recipe names. Pass, every aim.*: the stamp lands on the aimed document within 3 mm of the pointer's spot on it; an accepted stroke prints once in its verdict's ink and the die stops within 0.5 mm of the surface; a refused one prints nothing; a re-grab carries nothing mid-stroke. Then (d) on the eleventh traveller in the office view, ten let-gos each over the rack's box, the chip reader, the scanner and the bare desk (letGo.*: over a prop no stroke, no cue, the dater seats; over the desk the thump, the die on the plane, the 6 mm bounce; letGoCarry.*: the recipe's literal per-frame line). Needs StampRig's ops."
